7
00:00:31.790 --> 00:00:37.510
Mushure memaminitsi gumi nemashanu, inofanira kubhadharwa zvakakwana uye kushanda kwemaawa akawanda.

8
00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:41.390
Kuisiya muchiedza chezuva kunoita kuti bhatiri rirambe rakachajwa.

9
00:00:41.730 --> 00:00:44.970
Iwe hauzodi kutsiva chero mabhatiri kana magirobhu.

10
00:00:45.550 --> 00:00:49.090
