11
00:00:50.660 --> 00:00:54.980
Chinja kuita ziso modhi nekubata bhatani pasi kwemasekonzi gumi nemashanu.

12
00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:59.920
Zvadaro simudza zvigunwe zvako uye nekukurumidza kudzvanya zvakare sezvo chiedza chinopenya.

13
00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:04.560
Iwe zvino wave mune yeziso mode, uko iyo ophthalmoscope ichauya

