kutanga, ipapo anterior segment loupe.

15
00:01:08.100 --> 00:01:13.960
Kudzokorora nhanho idzi kunotenderera nenzira nhatu dzakasiyana dzekushandisa.

16
00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:15.740
General kushandiswa, maziso, ipapo nzeve.

17
